  "content": "<h1>Eyelib</h1>\n<p>用于 <em>Minecraft</em> 的渲染库。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/maven-central/v/io.github.tt432/eyelib\" alt=\"Maven Central Version\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdeepwiki.com%252fTT432%252feyelib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://deepwiki.com/badge.svg\" alt=\"Ask DeepWiki\"></a></p>\n<h2>快速开始</h2>\n<p>该库已发布至 Maven Central。</p>\n<pre><code>dependencies {\n    implementation \"io.github.tt432:eyelib:${eyelib_version}\"\n}</code></pre>\n<p>或者，您可以使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.cursemaven.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseMaven</a>。</p>\n<h2>依赖项</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TT432/antlr-molang\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Antlr-Molang</a> 用于解析 Molang。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/dmlloyd/jdk-classfile-backport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">jdk-classfile-backport</a> 用于生成 Molang 的字节码。</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fprojectlombok.org%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">lombok</a> 用于生成 getter/setter 等。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TT432/chin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chin</a> 用于工具类。</li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
